  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for the Environment Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Serbia):  .To secure Serbia&apos;s sustainable development, USAID&apos;s Together for the Environment activity will improve environmental and biodiversity protection by building the capacity of relevant actors, piloting sustainable financing mechanisms, and increasing citizen engagement in oversight and decision making related to natural resources and biodiversity protection. ..The activity will conduct a critical review of Serbia&apos;s nature protection system, with a particular focus on good governance and protected area management practices. USAID will also design a nature management program to drive transformative change across the protected area management system, informed by evidence and international best practices. Finally, the activity will establish a &quot;Guardians of Nature&quot; program to provide tailored capacity development for protected area stakeholders through high-quality training programs, mentorship, and cross-sectoral collaboration, drawing on strong links to U.S. best practices...This activity supports the USG&apos;s priorities to promote climate security and resilience and to renew and champion democracy and human rights. It also supports USAID&apos;s Climate Strategy and ICS Mission Objective 3.1 &quot;Serbia Strengthens Public Health and Environmental Protection Institutions and Takes Concrete Steps to Address Climate Change.&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
